 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "정중한 부탁 Could you...? / Would you mind...? / Can I...?",
   "en": "polite requests: Could you...?, Would you mind...? and Can I...?"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "부탁할 때는 Could you + 동사원형 ...?, 허락을 구할 때는 Could I + 동사원형 ...?을 씁니다. 아주 정중하게는 Would you mind + 동사-ing ...?를 쓰고, 이때 '좋아요'라는 대답은 'No, not at all.' 또는 'Of course.'입니다. 거절은 'I'm afraid I can't.'처럼 부드럽게 말합니다.",
   "en": "Use Could you + base verb ...? to ask someone to do something, and Could I + base verb ...? to ask permission. For very polite requests use Would you mind + verb-ing ...? (answer 'Of course' or 'No, not at all'). Refuse gently: I'm afraid I can't."
  },
  "table": {
   "head": [
    "표현 / Pattern",
    "예 / Example"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "Could you + 동사",
     "Could you open the door, please?"
    ],
    [
     "Could I + 동사",
     "Could I borrow your pen?"
    ],
    [
     "Would you mind + -ing",
     "Would you mind closing the window?"
    ],
    [
     "거절 / refusing",
     "I'm afraid I can't."
    ]
   ]
  },
  "notes": [
   {
    "ko": "부탁 = Could you ..., 허락 = Could I ...",
    "en": "Request = Could you ...; permission = Could I ..."
   },
   {
    "ko": "Would you mind 뒤에는 -ing: Would you mind opening ...?",
    "en": "After Would you mind use -ing: Would you mind opening ...?"
   },
   {
    "ko": "please를 붙이면 더 정중합니다.",
    "en": "Adding please makes it more polite."
   }
  ],
  "examples": [
   {
    "t": "Could you open the door, please?",
    "ko": "문을 열어 주시겠어요?"
   },
   {
    "t": "Could I borrow your pen?",
    "ko": "펜을 빌려도 될까요?"
   },
   {
    "t": "Would you mind closing the window?",
    "ko": "창문을 닫아 주시겠어요?"
   },
   {
    "t": "Could you speak more slowly?",
    "ko": "천천히 말씀해 주시겠어요?"
   },
   {
    "t": "I'm afraid I can't.",
    "ko": "죄송하지만 안 돼요."
   }
  ],
